"`罗技 HD Pro 网络摄像头 C920 <http://www.logitech.com/en-us/product/hd-pro-"
"webcam-c920>`__ 是图像处理应用的推荐摄像头，因为它原生使用 h264 格式编码图像。"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:44
#: 437f5aeebc2d4356815179f84b2d51f2
msgid ""
"The usable resolution of this webcam is limited to 640 x 480 (or perhaps "
"1280 x 720) because no official Linux driver has been written for this "
"camera yet."
msgstr "该网络摄像头的可用分辨率限制为 640 x 480（或 1280 x 720），因为目前尚未为该摄像头编写官方 Linux 驱动程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:48
#: 9490cb63325b489a84f4764c03e93b15
