#: 5635210e9c24487bb7a13483dd138a07
msgid ""
"`Please refer to the instructions for the Raspberry Pi "
"<https://www.raspberrypi.org/documentation/remote-access/ssh/>`__."
msgstr ""
"`请参阅 Raspberry Pi 的相关说明 <https://www.raspberrypi.org/documentation/remote-"
"access/ssh/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:161
#: 3340589d74e94a389ec637e3372b5954
msgid "Installing the required packages"
msgstr "安装所需软件包"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:163
#: 017ef7feada94554b251bc96b63a48f6
msgid "This assumes you have a SSH connection to the Pi."
msgstr "假设您已通过 SSH 连接到 Pi。"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:165
#: c5f3abfd16c145d3a4e7d406a0597500
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`MAVProxy Documentation<mavproxy:mavproxy-"
"downloadinstalllinux>` for install instructions"
msgstr "安装说明请参见 :ref:`MAVProxy 文档 <mavproxy:mavproxy-downloadinstalllinux>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:168
#: eb1e788be2cd4feca6a49fbf3e757e15
msgid "Testing the connection"
msgstr "测试连接"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:170
#: 36a3be8a13504f33884bf08e8e6f3361
msgid ""
"Before attempting this, you will need to connect to your Pixhawk via mission"
" planner with the USB cable."
msgstr "在尝试此操作之前，您需要通过 USB 线缆用 Mission Planner 连接到 Pixhawk。"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:173
#: d5d8161509bd4a3ab8f0a86a758816d8
msgid "Set SERIAL2_BAUD (telemetry 2 baud rate) to 1500 (1.5Mbit)"
msgstr "将 SERIAL2_BAUD（数传 2 波特率）设置为 1500（1.5Mbit）"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:178
#: 0d62a912908a4549b9792a3d9b70785f
msgid ""
"To test the ODroid and Pixhawk are able to communicate with each other first"
" ensure both are powered, then in a console on the Odroid type:"
msgstr "要测试 ODroid 和 Pixhawk 能否相互通信，首先确保两者均已上电，然后在 ODroid 控制台输入："

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:181
#: a7630bb9559345ad99fde6f13d67536c
msgid ""
"``mavproxy.py --master=/dev/ttyUSB0 --baudrate 1500000 --aircraft MyCopter``"
msgstr ""
"``mavproxy.py --master=/dev/ttyUSB0 --baudrate 1500000 --aircraft MyCopter``"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:183
#: b16e77bd1e3b4d558204c755d83f0bc7
msgid ""
"once mavproxy has started you should be able to type in the following "
"commands to arm and then disarm the copter."
msgstr "MAVProxy 启动后，您应该能够输入以下命令对多旋翼进行解锁和上锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:186
#: 62f3ab2a7bc34e77b3bd8f4f97998191
msgid "``arm throttle``"
msgstr "``arm throttle``"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:188
#: 865c10cbcdbc4608a845214862621d01
msgid "disarm"
msgstr "disarm"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:194
#: d937fe9ea0b54b1da0902c40dcabadb8
msgid "Configure mavproxy to always run"
msgstr "配置 MAVProxy 始终运行"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:196
#: 0d050f07f51746de8886eaa3a220a077
msgid ""
"This is accomplished by adding the following to the end of your "
"\"/home/odroid/.bashrc\" file. The Pixhawk is connected via \"ttyUSB0\". The"
" last section of the file should look like below.  **Change the IP address "
"to that of your ground station** (this also starts the balloon finder, "
"comment that line out if you don't want it to run)"
msgstr ""
"这可通过在 「/home/odroid/.bashrc」文件末尾添加以下内容来实现。Pixhawk "
"通过「ttyUSB0」连接。文件最后部分应如下所示。**请将 IP 地址更改为您的地面站 IP** "
"（这也会启动气球查找程序，如果不需要运行请注释该行）。"

#: ../../source/docs/odroid-via-mavlink.rst:217
#: d82f525d47884d1b9d5461c41f6be3ce
msgid "Connecting with the Mission Planner"
